  "description": "<p data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:61\"><strong>Discover Your Radiance with Rallecent's Beauty Collection</strong></p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:303\">Welcome to Rallecent's curated beauty collection, where self-care meets sophistication. We believe that true beauty radiates from within, enhanced by products that nourish and empower. Explore a hand-picked selection of skincare, makeup, and haircare essentials designed to elevate your natural beauty.</p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:409\">Our collection features high-quality products from trusted brands, each chosen for its efficacy, ingredients, and commitment to ethical practices. Whether you're seeking a flawless complexion, vibrant hair, or a touch of glamour, you'll find something to enhance your unique style. From luxurious serums to everyday makeup must-haves, we offer a range of products to suit every skin type and beauty routine.</p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:366\"><strong>What sets Rallecent apart?</strong> We're passionate about providing more than just beauty products. We offer a personalized experience, guiding you to discover the perfect items to complement your individual needs and aspirations. <span class=\"citation-0 citation-end-0 interactive-span-selected-v2\">Our team is dedicated to providing exceptional customer service, ensuring your shopping experience is seamless and enjoyable.<sup data-turn-source-index=\"1\" class=\"superscript visible highlight\" _ngcontent-ng-c572565009=\"\">&nbsp;</sup></span><span class=\"button-container hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" hide-from-message-actions=\"\" _ngcontent-ng-c2799820430=\"\"> &nbsp;<!----></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c2799820430=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><sources-carousel style=\"display: flex; visibility: visible;\" class=\"ng-tns-c4089873471-16 hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c4089873471=\"\" id=\"sources\" hide-from-message-actions=\"\" _ngcontent-ng-c2799820430=\"\"></sources-carousel></sources-carousel-inline></p>\r\n<div jslog=\"220997;BardVeMetadataKey:[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[1,null,1]]\" class=\"container ng-tns-c4089873471-16\" _ngcontent-ng-c4089873471=\"\"><!---->\r\n<div class=\"carousel-container ng-tns-c4089873471-16\" _ngcontent-ng-c4089873471=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"carousel-content ng-tns-c4089873471-16\" _ngcontent-ng-c4089873471=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"sources-carousel-source ng-tns-c4089873471-16 ng-star-inserted\" data-test-id=\"sources-carousel-source\" _ngcontent-ng-c4089873471=\"\"><card-renderer class=\"ng-tns-c4089873471-16 ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c2388921638=\"\" _ngcontent-ng-c4089873471=\"\"><!----><!----><!----></card-renderer>\r\n<div class=\"source-card-container\" _ngcontent-ng-c1799685868=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"source-card-content\" _ngcontent-ng-c1799685868=\"\"><a jslog=\"180390;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[\" r_00616c175f5a86f6\",\"c_c34237c7a875dd4f\",null,\"rc_32316c989fc1f623\",\"http:=\"\" www.eventmarjo.in=\"\" product-category=\"\" eshop=\"\" \",null,\"en\",null,1,null,null,1,0]]\"=\"\" href=\"http://www.eventmarjo.in/product-category/eshop/\" class=\"link\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" _ngcontent-ng-c1799685868=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"source-card-body\" _ngcontent-ng-c1799685868=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"source-card-header\" _ngcontent-ng-c1799685868=\"\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</a>\r\n<div class=\"source-card-footer\" _ngcontent-ng-c1799685868=\"\"><a jslog=\"180390;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[\" r_00616c175f5a86f6\",\"c_c34237c7a875dd4f\",null,\"rc_32316c989fc1f623\",\"http:=\"\" www.eventmarjo.in=\"\" product-category=\"\" eshop=\"\" \",null,\"en\",null,1,null,null,1,0]]\"=\"\" href=\"http://www.eventmarjo.in/product-category/eshop/\" class=\"link\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" _ngcontent-ng-c1799685868=\"\"><span aria-label=\"Opens in a new window\" _ngcontent-ng-c1799685868=\"